{"completed": true, "response": "熟悉的歌声再次浮起，却比先前更加丰盈、缠绵。旋律仿佛不再满足于轻声倾诉，每一次回旋都添上一层细密的波光，温柔里渐渐透出难以掩饰的迷恋。那些轻巧的装饰音像水珠接连溅起，晶莹而灵动，让原本亲密的气息变得愈发热切。音乐仍在从容流动，情感却似乎悄悄越过了矜持的边界，时而舒展，时而依依不舍地盘旋。到了后段，高处忽然闪起一片细密的颤动，像夕阳斜照水面，一道金光被波纹反复揉碎，又不断重新聚拢。时间仿佛在这里短暂悬停，流动与凝望奇妙地交织在一起。那光芒明亮得近乎令人屏息，却又轻盈、柔软，久久不愿散去。", "metadata": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "headless": true, "provider_interface": true, "no_auto_retry": true, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\yi-cookie-repair-20261006\\job-e390ba7d4faa4ee7bf9e6c62460b0952", "response_sha256": "556201e0c9749459c573f5f660533e27aefeb354c37bdedefc98657f48a1f0c9", "session_handle": "32d03172-d243-47fd-bf71-8c20232d2e91", "attachments": [], "prompt_normalization": "single_leading_BOM_removed_CRLF_or_CR_to_LF_and_trim_end", "pre_submit_scope": null, "initialization": {"source": "native_pre_send_aborted_handoff", "browser_assisted_initialization": true, "native_browser_generation_sent": false, "http_version": "auto", "nonpersonalization_inherited": false, "handoff_age_seconds": 0.856, "state": "claimed"}, "headless_initializer": {"headless": true, "native_browser_generation_sent": false, "completed": true, "browser_version": {"type": "string", "length": 13, "sha256": "9722c94be680575b307b26183e1a423460d4568949ad7f3e7f985d33d9bf0e26"}, "sealed_handoff_written": true, "browser_closed": true, "cloned_private_profile_removed": true, "elapsed_seconds": 6.798}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "continuation_expected": false, "handoff_seen": false, "lifecycle_updates": 87, "first_assistant_seconds": 0.031, "first_text_seconds": 0.187, "stream_seconds": 10.719, "channel_update_counts": {"final": 80}, "bounded_server_observations": {"scope": "http_sse", "tool_message_observation_count": 0, "truncated": false, "scalar_patch_tool_role_inheritance": false, "message_finished_successfully_is_tool_success": false, "tool_result_observations": [], "reasoning_observations": [{"finished_duration